      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:1866_U.S._Coast_Survey_Nautical_Chart_of_Map_of_New_York_City_and_Harbor_-_Geographicus_-_NewYorkCity3-uscs-1866.jpg",
